        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% 1. 顶部：逻辑计算树 (Logical Computation Tree)\n    subgraph LCT [\&quot;Logical Computation Tree\&quot;]\n        Root([Root])\n        Root --&gt; L1_1[...]\n        Root --&gt; L1_2[...]\n        L1_1 --&gt; L2_1[...]\n        L1_2 --&gt; L2_2[...]\n    end\n\n    %% 树向分区层过渡\n    LCT --&gt; TP[Tree Partitioning]\n\n    %% 2. 中间：分区层 (Tree Partitioning)\n    TP --&gt; P1[Piece 1]\n    TP --&gt; P2[Piece 2]\n    TP --&gt; PD[...]\n    TP --&gt; Pm[Piece m]\n\n    %% 右侧独立旁注（使用 ~~~ 隐式占位，实现同排右对齐且不产生任何连线）\n    Pm ~~~ Note[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;If &lt;i&gt;m &gt; P&lt;/i&gt;:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Only a subset of pieces&lt;br/&gt;can be active simultaneously.\&quot;]\n\n    %% 3. 调度映射层 (Scheduling / Mapping Layer)\n    P1 --&gt; SML[Scheduling / Mapping Layer]\n    P2 --&gt; SML\n    PD --&gt; SML\n    Pm --&gt; SML\n\n    %% 4. 底部：有限执行资源池 (finite execution resources)\n    subgraph FER [\&quot;finite execution resources\&quot;]\n        S1[Slot 1]\n        S2[Slot 2]\n        SD[...]\n        SP[Slot P]\n    end\n\n    SML --&gt; S1\n    SML --&gt; S2\n    SML --&gt; SD\n    SML --&gt; SP\n\n    %% 样式美化\n    style L1_1 fill:none,stroke:none\n    style L1_2 fill:none,stroke:none\n    style L2_1 fill:none,stroke:none\n    style L2_2 fill:none,stroke:none\n    style PD fill:none,stroke:none\n    style SD fill:none,stroke:none\n    style Note fill:#FFFBE6,stroke:#FAAD14,stroke-dasharray: 5 5,stroke-width:1.5px&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="OTcRFeliIzJRzXUFhxmJ-1">
